      "id": "claim_a6d98a471516486e9cbf39e4716b2058",
      "statement": "The file watcher uses watchdog library to monitor `/src` recursively. Changes to supported file types (.mdx, .md, .json, .svg, .png, .jpg, .css, .js, etc.) are queued and debounced with a 0.2-second delay to batch rapid changes before rebuilding.",
      "evidence": [
        {
