    {
      "id": "claim_465327dcab584d9c842d6110fa8d3884",
      "statement": "The dev command spawns Mintlify dev server at port 3000 in the `/build` directory. On Windows, it uses shell execution for .CMD compatibility; on Unix, it uses direct exec.",
